 ## Scenario: 新增一个 contentType 的 ingest 转写器
 
+### Explicit editorial revisions (CLI issue 17, 2026-11-20)
+
+- `POST /admin/drafts/:id/revise` creates a pending revision from an accepted source; it never publishes or calls agents. The accepted source is immutable. A stable request key replays the same receipt before freshness checks; reuse with different content is a conflict.
+- `ingest_draft_acceptance` records successful accepted-draft/entity associations. `ingest_draft_revision` stores trusted target identity, a formal-content baseline and the initial candidate baseline. These controls must never come from producer `source`, `data`, or `parentDraftId`. Legacy sources require an unambiguous verified target, or a verified explicit target ID.
+- Revision acceptance runs under the existing review transaction and target row locks. Compare the current formal fingerprint, update only the selected locale and editorial fields, preserve publication time, other locales and operational identity. Do not call full-replacement CRUD (which can delete other locales) or create-only transcribers (which duplicate FAQ/changelog or collide on blog slug).
+- Model-info revisions still use the model content validation/normalization path. Sources owned by the specialized overview-refill workflow must use that workflow, not generic revision. Generic revision acceptance skips production-converge, translation and topic dispatch; retain post-commit cache invalidation.
+- Revision candidates use `update` with a draft version guard. AI `modify` and rejected-candidate derivation are explicitly rejected; create a new revision from the accepted original instead, so trusted target metadata cannot be dropped.
+- Pending Showcase copy editing is a separate `title`/`introduce` allowlist. Preserve the entire historical input, prompt, artifact, media and schema hash, even when current route schema differs. All forbidden keys fail atomically. New guarded updates advance `updatedAt` by at least one millisecond.
+- Regression anchor: `tests/modules/review/draft-revise.test.ts`, plus SDK `ingest-update-modify.test.ts`. Live staging verification is a separate deployment gate, not implied by local tests.
+
 ### 1. Scope / Trigger
 
 - Trigger: agents 产线新增制品类型要直投 content-api ingest 并经 review 队列落域实体（判例：playground-example / model-info / model-cover / model-poster / model-api-params / **blog（2026-10-06·S0）**）。
