+# Feasibility findings
+
+- CLI baseline is v0.4.0; local original checkout was eight commits behind origin/main. Implementation uses an isolated current worktree.
+- API update explicitly rejects accepted drafts and Showcase. Shared edit rules also control agent modify, so copy-only Showcase editing must not accidentally enable agent generation.
